{
  "id": "1SA.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 12",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Samweli yeelwatsila abandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Samweli nasunjila Isiraeli yosi ari Lole, ndahuliile akemioyo chieenywe mukosi aka mwamboolela, ninyemekha omuruchi amuruche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, lole, omuruchi amwimilila; nasi endi omukofu wetsimbutsi; khandi lole, abaana banje muli ninabo; nasi ndamwimiliilenje okhurula khubusooliili bwanje okhuula olwa leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nisie uno; muboole akobuloli khwisie imbeli w, khandi imbeli wamasihiwe; mbu niwina owa ndabukula ing'ombeye? Kata niwina owa nadabukula isishiliye? Kata niwina owa ndasandia? Niwina nwa ndakania? Kata niwina owa ndabukula eshiomufuusi okhurula khuye, mbu shibofusie tsimoni tsianje? Emukalusilie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibaboola bari Shiwakhusandia, kata okhukhusakania, kata shiwabukula eshindu shiosi mumukhono kwomundu yesi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabasunjila ari OMWAMI niye omuloli khwinywe, khandi masihiwe niye omuloli inyanga yino, mbu shimunyoolile likhuwa liosi khwisie ta. Nibasunga mbu Abe omuloli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Samweli nasunjila abandu ari Niye OMWAMI watsana owaraho Musa nende Haruni, owatsana owatikulusia abakuuka beenywe okhurula mushialo shia Misiri, ouli omuloli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano mwemeho, khufunane nineenywe imbeli w khubikhole ebiobulunjishi biOMWAMI, ebia yamukholela inywe nende abakuuka beenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa Yakobo yali niyeenjiile eMisiri, abaMisiri nibabasakania, abakuuka beenywe nibamuhaabila OMWAMI, nilwo olwa OMWAMI yaruma Musa nende Haruni, nabo nibarusia abakuuka beenywe eMisiri, nibachila nibamenya habundu hano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa bamala nibeebilila OMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe, naye nabakusia mumukhono kwaSisera, omuseesia welihe liaHazori, khandi mumakhono kabaFilisiti, khandi mumukhono kwomuruchi waMoabu, nabo nibaseerana ninabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nibahaabila OMWAMI, nibasunga bari Khwayoonoonile, okhuba khwamuleshile OMWAMI, nikhukhalabanila emiBaali nende emiAshitarotsi; ne bulaano, okhuhonie mumakhono kabasuku beefwe, neefu khulakhukhalabanila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI naruma Yerubaali, nende Baraki, nende Yefitsa, nende Samweli, namuhonia mumakhono kabasuku beenywe tsimbeka tsiosi, neenyu nimumenya shisale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa mwalola shinga Nahashi omuruchi wabaAmoni olwa yeetsa okhumuseera, mwasunjila muri Tawe, habula omuruchi alakhuruka; olwa OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe yali ye omuruchi weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano mulole omuruchi owa mwalobola, ngwowuno, omwenoyo owa mwasaba; lole, OMWAMI yareeleho omuruchi mbu amuruche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuba nimuria OMWAMI nimumukhalabanila, nende okhuhulila omwoyokwe, nimurakhaya lilako liOMWAMI ta, inywe halala nende omuruchi oumuruka nimuba abalondi bOMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe, nobulayi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula nimuba nimurahulila omwoyo kwOMWAMI ta, nimukhaya lilako liOMWAMI, kho mana omukhono kwOMWAMI kulamuyinga, shinga olwa kwabayinga abakuuka beenywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano mwemeho, mulole likhuwa lino likhongo elia OMWAMI yeetsa okhukhola imbeli weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leelo shilili lichesa lieingano? Nemusabe OMWAMI mbu aleere okhukukuma khwelikulu, nende ifula; mana namumanye nimulola obumayaanu bweenywe shinga olwa buli obunji, obwa mwakholile imbeli wOMWAMI, nimusaba murio omuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Samweli yasaaya OMWAMI; OMWAMI naye naleera okhukukuma khwelikulu halala nende ifula inyanga yeneyo; abandu bosi nibaria OMWAMI nende Samweli yesi muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu bosi nibamusunjila Samweli bari Okhusaayile if we abasumbabo ewa OMWAMI Nyasayewo, mbu khuleshe okhufwa; shichila khwatasa khubionoono bieefwe biosi libii lino, mbu okhusaba omuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Samweli nasunjila abandu ari Murarie tawe; toto mwene, mwakhola obubii buno bwosi; ne khandi murashiama oburalonda OMWAMI tawe, ne mbu mumukhalabanile OMWAMI nende omwoyo kweenywe kwosi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne murashiama nimulonda ebindu ebikhaya, ebiranyala okhukaasila eshindu kata okhumuhonia, tawe; okhuba nebikhaya butswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba OMWAMI shialeebala abandube tawe, khulwa eliiralie likhongo; shichila OMWAMI yali niyachama okhumukhola mube abandu bebe omwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi khandi khulwanje, shikakhoyeele nahatuutu ta mbu emwonoonele OMWAMI, nindekha okhumusaayila inywe, ne mbu ndalamwibaalila munjila eyili indayi khandi ingololofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula mbu mumuriitsenje OMWAMI, nimumukhalabanila mubwatieri nende omwoyo kweenywe kwosi; ne mwitsulile amakhuwa shinga olwa kali amakhongo aka yamukholeele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nimuba nimushikhola obubii, mulamululwa, inywe halala nende omuruchi weenywe yesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
